[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2460140699","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98898#issuecomment-2460140699","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98898","id":2460140699,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6SosSb","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-06T15:55:35Z","updated_at":"2024-11-06T15:55:35Z","body":"Hmm, so the minimum Python version that 22.04 supports is `3.7`. I'll add a conditional to use 20.04 for the legacy check, but we might want to update our Python minimum soon","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2460140699/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2460153094","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98898#issuecomment-2460153094","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98898","id":2460153094,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6SovUG","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-06T15:59:45Z","updated_at":"2024-11-06T15:59:45Z","body":"Yeah Python 3.6 has been EOL for 3 years now, we can likely drop support for it too.\r\n\r\nPython 3.8 just went EOL, we could probably use it as our new min version and not cut off too many users on legacy distros or Python setups.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2460153094/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2460290612","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98898#issuecomment-2460290612","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98898","id":2460290612,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6SpQ40","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-06T16:49:08Z","updated_at":"2024-11-06T16:49:08Z","body":"Testing locally, I also need to do this fix, like in my `3.x` PR:\r\n```diff\r\ndiff --git a/scene/2d/tile_map.cpp b/scene/2d/tile_map.cpp\r\nindex ddb0635f6b..1bfd1fed5a 100644\r\n--- a/scene/2d/tile_map.cpp\r\n+++ b/scene/2d/tile_map.cpp\r\n@@ -75,7 +75,8 @@ void TileMap::_set_tile_map_data_using_compatibility_format(int p_layer, TileMap\r\n \tfor (int i = 0; i < c; i += offset) {\r\n \t\tconst uint8_t *ptr = (const uint8_t *)&r[i];\r\n \t\tuint8_t local[12];\r\n-\t\tfor (int j = 0; j < ((p_format >= TileMapDataFormat::TILE_MAP_DATA_FORMAT_2) ? 12 : 8); j++) {\r\n+\t\tconst int buffer_size = (p_format >= TileMapDataFormat::TILE_MAP_DATA_FORMAT_2) ? 12 : 8;\r\n+\t\tfor (int j = 0; j < buffer_size; j++) {\r\n \t\t\tlocal[j] = ptr[j];\r\n \t\t}\r\n \r\n```\r\n\r\nFor the PacketPeerUDP / RingBuffer stringop-overflow, I don't reproduce it locally with GCC 14 for some reason.\r\nBut I wondered if this would solve it?\r\n```diff\r\ndiff --git a/core/io/packet_peer_udp.h b/core/io/packet_peer_udp.h\r\nindex c69a138c53..724a902960 100644\r\n--- a/core/io/packet_peer_udp.h\r\n+++ b/core/io/packet_peer_udp.h\r\n@@ -49,7 +49,7 @@ protected:\r\n \tuint8_t recv_buffer[PACKET_BUFFER_SIZE];\r\n \tuint8_t packet_buffer[PACKET_BUFFER_SIZE];\r\n \tIPAddress packet_ip;\r\n-\tint packet_port = 0;\r\n+\tuint32_t packet_port = 0;\r\n \tint queue_count = 0;\r\n \r\n \tIPAddress peer_addr;\r\n```","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2460290612/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2460318023","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98898#issuecomment-2460318023","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98898","id":2460318023,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6SpXlH","user":{"login":"fire","id":32321,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMzIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32321?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire","html_url":"https://github.com/fire","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-06T17:01:08Z","updated_at":"2024-11-06T17:01:08Z","body":"Seems to be a requirement for https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/89660 because of GCC versions?","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2460318023/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2460364214","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98898#issuecomment-2460364214","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98898","id":2460364214,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Spi22","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-06T17:22:39Z","updated_at":"2024-11-06T17:22:39Z","body":"You _might_ be able to remove this, if Ubuntu 22.04 has a recent enough version of Mesa.\r\n```\r\n      # Need newer mesa for lavapipe to work properly.\r\n      - name: Linux dependencies for tests\r\n        if: matrix.proj-test\r\n        run: |\r\n          sudo rm -f /etc/apt/sources.list.d/microsoft-prod.list\r\n          sudo apt-key adv --keyserver keyserver.ubuntu.com --recv-keys EB8B81E14DA65431D7504EA8F63F0F2B90935439\r\n          sudo add-apt-repository \"deb https://ppa.launchpadcontent.net/kisak/turtle/ubuntu focal main\"\r\n          sudo apt-get install -qq mesa-vulkan-drivers\r\n```\r\nIf not, the `focal` part needs to be updated to `jammy` (Ubuntu version codename).","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2460364214/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2460368312","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98898#issuecomment-2460368312","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98898","id":2460368312,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Spj24","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-06T17:24:46Z","updated_at":"2024-11-06T20:47:20Z","body":"I'll keep this a draft until your implementation is merged, so I'll know what to reference\r\n\r\nIn the meantime, I'll cook up a PR making 3.8 the minimum Python version\r\n\r\n**Edit:** badabing:\r\n- #98907","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2460368312/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2460378393","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98898#issuecomment-2460378393","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98898","id":2460378393,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6SpmUZ","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-06T17:29:47Z","updated_at":"2024-11-06T17:31:22Z","body":"> Python 3.8 just went EOL, we could probably use it as our new min version and not cut off too many users on legacy distros or Python setups.\r\n\r\nNote that raising the requirement *above* Python 3.8 will break [Pyston](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/contributing/development/compiling/compiling_for_linuxbsd.html#using-pyston-for-faster-development) though, which I still rely upon as it allows for faster rebuilds.\r\n\r\nCPython 3.13 onwards is starting to focus on performance, but it's not at the level of Pyston yet. (There is also an experimental JIT, but it doesn't work with SCons.)\r\n\r\nUnfortunately, Pyston is unmaintained these days, so it won't see any support newer than Python 3.8. Sphinx has already dropped Python 3.8 support, but SCons still supports it for now.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2460378393/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2468918214","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98898#issuecomment-2468918214","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98898","id":2468918214,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6TKLPG","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-11T19:52:20Z","updated_at":"2024-11-11T19:52:20Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2468918214/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2477840935","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98898#issuecomment-2477840935","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98898","id":2477840935,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6TsNon","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-15T02:41:34Z","updated_at":"2024-11-15T02:41:34Z","body":"This caused a regression for tilemaps. This is how the Isometric demo looks now:\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6074c646-6fe8-4a3e-bc1b-5cd9e54e6585)\r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2477840935/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2490896984","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98898#issuecomment-2490896984","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98898","id":2490896984,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6UeBJY","user":{"login":"ghost","id":10137,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTM3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10137?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost","html_url":"https://github.com/ghost","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-21T11:42:44Z","updated_at":"2024-11-21T11:42:44Z","body":"> > Python 3.8 just went EOL, we could probably use it as our new min version and not cut off too many users on legacy distros or Python setups.\r\n> \r\n> Note that raising the requirement _above_ Python 3.8 will break [Pyston](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/contributing/development/compiling/compiling_for_linuxbsd.html#using-pyston-for-faster-development) though, which I still rely upon as it allows for faster rebuilds.\r\n> \r\n> CPython 3.13 onwards is starting to focus on performance, but it's not at the level of Pyston yet. (There is also an experimental JIT, but it doesn't work with SCons.)\r\n> \r\n> Unfortunately, Pyston is unmaintained these days, so it won't see any support newer than Python 3.8. Sphinx has already dropped Python 3.8 support, but SCons still supports it for now.\r\n\r\nToday I've tested speed of Pyston in comparison to CPython and it is not so astonishing now. I've run builds on already built repo so it just needed to execute python:\r\n \r\n\r\n**Pyston 2.3.5: ~17.5s\r\nCPython 3.12.6: ~20.2s**\r\n\r\nAnd these are results of my low-end i3 which makes clean build 1.5 hours. I think you even won't notice any difference on your hardware. I even didn't try CPython 3.13 with enabled JIT...","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2490896984/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]